AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0020111> "Identification of Treg cells remains problematic, because accumulating evidence suggests that all the presently-used Treg markers (CD25, CTLA-4, GITR, LAG-3, CD127 and Foxp3) represent general T-cell activation markers, rather than being truly Treg-specific.")
