# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025030> (Enteric neuronal degeneration)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025030> "Deterioration of enteric neurons with impairment of enteric neuronal structure. Typical neuropathological findings include qualitative (e.g., neuronal swelling, intranuclear inclusions, axonal degeneration) and quantitative (e.g., reduction in the number of neurons) abnormalities of the enteric neurons.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025030> "2016-08-27T11:43:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025030> "Degenerative enteric neuropathy")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025030> "Enteric neuronal degeneration")
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025030> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000639> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0007011>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002573> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000460>))))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025030> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025029>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025031> (Abnormality of the digestive system)

