AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025044> "Lung abscess may occur in the context of unusual susceptibility to infection and is characteristic of phagocyte defects (chronic granulomatous disease), antibody deficiencies, and severe T-cell deficiencies, with typical pathogens including Staphylococcus aureus, Klebsiella pneumoniae, Aspergillus, and anaerobes.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025044> "Lung abscess")
