# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025084> (Folliculitis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025084> "Inflammatory cells within the wall and ostia of the hair follicle, creating a follicular-based pustule.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025084> "2016-10-15T13:35:26Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
