AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025084> "In contrast to folliculitis, perifolliculitis refers to inflammatory cells, usually lymphocytes, within the perifollicular tissues with focal extension into the adjacent reticular dermis. Folliculitis and perifolliculitis can occur independently or incombination owing to follicular disruption and irritation.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025084> "Folliculitis")
