# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025234> (Parasomnia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:22965264") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35956054") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40132982") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025234> "A clinically observable or self-reported abnormal behavior, experience, or physiological event that occurs in association with sleep, specific sleep stages, or sleep-wake transitions.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025234> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6262-8264>)
